{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06065","headline":"奉和圣制暮春送朝集使归郡应制 · 王维","name":"奉和圣制暮春送朝集使归郡应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万国仰宗周，衣冠拜冕旒。\n玉乘迎大客，金节送诸侯。\n祖席倾三省，褰帷向九州。\n杨花飞上路，槐色荫通沟。\n来预钧天乐，归分汉主忧。\n宸章类河汉，垂象满中州。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06065.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06065","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}